Upstream-bound: no
Subject: [PORT_HOST] P6.2 EU boots at the country select

The European version starts at CNTY_SEL (MODE_COUNTRY_SELECT), where the
player picks the language (LANGUAGE) before the opening movie and the
title, as on the PS1. The US host boot still goes straight to MODE_TITLE.
DW3_START_MODE still overrides both.

diff -ruN a/src/engine/game/state.c b/src/engine/game/state.c
--- a/src/engine/game/state.c
+++ b/src/engine/game/state.c
@@ -10,9 +10,16 @@ long strtol(const char *nptr, char **endptr, int base);
 void newGame(void) {
     HEAP.zero(&GAME, GAME_SAVE_SIZE);
 #if PORT_HOST
+#if VERSION_EU
+    /* P6.2: as on the PS1, the European version starts at the country
+       select (CNTY_SEL), which sets LANGUAGE and goes on to the opening. */
+    GAME.mode = MODE_COUNTRY_SELECT;
+    GAME.nextMode = MODE_COUNTRY_SELECT;
+#else
     /* Phase 2: skip opening STR movies; go straight to the title screen. */
     GAME.mode = MODE_TITLE;
     GAME.nextMode = MODE_TITLE;
+#endif
 #elif VERSION_US || VERSION_JP
     GAME.mode = MODE_OPENING;
     GAME.nextMode = MODE_OPENING;
